## 95 | YÊ-SU RŎNG GÂP | TC 363, KM 83, KMM 168 | E♭ major | 2/4 | E♭,Gm,A♭,C7,Fm,B♭7 | 114:full page |
V:
Yê-su rŏng gâp, gâp gĭt ngăn. Ndrom sam-ƀŭt Brah Ndu lah jêh,
